  "notes": "Emphasizes setting a numerical or measurable cap. The noun form {制限|せいげん} is very common in everyday life.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {速度|そくど}{制限|せいげん}: speed limit\n- {年齢|ねんれい}{制限|せいげん}: age restriction\n- {時間|じかん}{制限|せいげん}: time limit\n- {制限|せいげん}{速度|そくど}: restricted speed\n- {食事|しょくじ}{制限|せいげん}: dietary restriction\n- {制限|せいげん}なく: without restriction\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {限定|げんてい}する: to limit — narrows scope or target group (members only, limited edition)\n- {制限|せいげん}する: to restrict — sets a numerical cap or upper bound (speed limit, time limit)\n- {規制|きせい}する: to regulate — imposes official rules and controls",
